    "",
    "## Method",
    "- Gap-fill target: `flux_total = FG_ENSEMBLE_RSHP + storage_flux_filled` from `flow.TotalFlux.R`.",
    "- Gap-fill model: Gaussian GAM with diel cycle, day-of-year cycle, filled air temperature, filled log(PAR), temperature-light interaction, season, and site random effect.",
    "- Annual budgets use complete calendar-year half-hour grids for every site-year present in the total-flux object.",
    "- Fluxes are converted to mg C m-2 30 min-1 with the same conversion used in `flow.30min.analysis.R`, then summed to g C m-2 yr-1.",
    "- Uncertainty combines GAM prediction SE for gap-filled intervals with site-level day-scale residual variability. Explicit measurement and storage-flux uncertainty are unavailable in the total-flux product and are not propagated.",
    "- Site random effects are used for prediction only when a site has at least 50 finite total-flux observations. Other sites use population-level predictions.",
    paste0("- Interpretable budget columns are retained only for site-years with at least ", min_interpretable_coverage * 100, "% observed total-flux coverage and at least 50 finite site observations."),
